# The scripted capsule session. lockstep-headless runs this file and prints its state hash,
# which must match the committed value on every platform.
#
# Lines: seed <number> | steps <number> | <step> move actor <x> <y> walk|run
#        <step> stop|injure|treat|restore actor | <step> multiplier <number>
seed 20260925
steps 10000
10 move actor 15 15 walk
200 injure actor
260 injure actor
330 injure actor
400 move actor 0 3 run
600 treat actor
700 move actor 99 99 run
800 multiplier 20
1000 restore actor
1100 restore actor
